  "created": "2025-05-08T16:06:43.227Z",
  "description": "This is a UI library for WPF developers based on WPF custom advanced controls. Welcome to use..\n\nhow to use：\n\nStep 1: Add nuget;\n\nInstall-Package WPFDevelopers -Version 1.1.0.3-preview1\n\nStep 2: App.xaml Add the namespace:\n\nxmlns:wd=\"https://github.com/WPFDevelopersOrg/WPFDevelopers\"\n\nStep 3: Add nodes to App.xaml;\n\n    <Application.Resources>\n        <ResourceDictionary>\n            <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>\n                     <ResourceDictionary Source=\"pack://application:,,,/WPFDevelopers;component/Themes/Theme.xaml\" />\n    <!--  需要注意 wd:Resources 必须在Theme.xaml后  -->\n    <!--  默认情况下，Theme 会跟随系统主题（适用于 Windows 10 及以上版本），自动切换为 Light 或 Dark 模式。\n                              若要手动设置为 Light 模式，可以使用 Theme=\"Light\"。\n                              你还可以自定义主题色，使用 Color=\"Fuchsia\"（例如设置为 Fuchsia）-->\n        <wd:Resources />\n            </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>\n        </ResourceDictionary>\n    </Application.Resources>\n        \n        \nStep 4: Add the namespace;\n\nxmlns:wd=\"https://github.com/WPFDevelopersOrg/WPFDevelopers\"\n\n加入QQ群：929469013 | 340500857 | 458041663",
